       due        |                                                              advice                                                              | same_rows 
------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------
 stale connection | REINDEX recommended (stale connection): the server does not rewrite an index by itself, REINDEX INDEX CONCURRENTLY facts_col does | t
